Description: graphical system monitor for Raspberry Pi
 sysmon is a PyQt6 desktop application that shows live rolling charts of
 CPU utilization, disk I/O, network I/O, CPU and drive temperatures, and
 fan speed, updating every second with 60 seconds of history.
 .
 The application runs from its own Python virtual environment in
 /usr/lib/sysmon/venv, which is created when the package is installed and
 uses the Debian-packaged PyQt6 and GPIO libraries.
